#: INTRO.md:1
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "はじめに"

#: INTRO.md:3
msgid ""
"This tutorial will teach you how to use PLUMED, GROMACS and Python notebooks"
" to implement an enhanced sampling strategy for magnesium-RNA binding "
"dynamics."
msgstr ""
"PLUMED、GROMACS、Python Notebooks を用いて、Magnesium-RNA Binding Dynamics のための "
"Enhanced Sampling 戦略を実装する方法を学ぶチュートリアル。"

